---A rule contains conditions, "unless conditions" and actions. For each envelope recipient of an email, if all conditions match and none of the "unless conditions" match, then all of the actions are executed sequentially. If no conditions are provided, the rule always applies and the actions are implicitly executed. If only "unless conditions" are provided, the rule applies if the email does not mat...
