---@field Unless? aws.mailmanager.RuleConditions The "unless conditions" of this rule. None of the conditions can match the email for the actions to be executed. If any of these conditions do match the email, then the actions are not executed.
---@field Actions aws.mailmanager.RuleActions The list of actions to execute when the conditions match the incoming email, and none of the "unless conditions" match.

